// The game's icon in cat_recomp.exe, with the opt-in CAT_APP_ICON CMake
// option (blinx2 package sets it): the taskbar shows the icon of the
// process that owns the window, which is the game, not the launcher. The
// launcher's own icon comes from xboxrecomp-cli's app.rc.in. The .ico is
// the game's title image; it never enters git.
1 ICON "@ICON@"
